      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "We emerged victorious from all the various wars and cataclisms. \nFrom
    a simple cell to a mighty civilisation ruling the entire planet in peace. No
    single ruler, no tyrant, just a commonwealth of the people. \nUnfortunately,
    we are being chased by a wild bunch of angry motherships. \nThey mean bussiness!\nWe
    jumped into an intergallactic wormhole (as you do) to avoid them.\n\nNow, the
    goal is clear: \nTo utilize the planet to the fullest, with minimal waste. \nThis
    can only end well!\n\n---------\n'Fun' fact:\nThe Kardashev Scale is a system
    for measuring how advanced is your gallactic civilization!\nYour civilization
    is currently Type I, which means it's trying to utilize the resources of the
    planet.\n\n"
